docs {
  # ACL Management Tests
  
  Tests for Access Control List (ACL) management APIs.
  
  ## What Are ACLs?
  
  ACLs control which environments can access which services in which zones/contexts. Each ACL entry specifies:
  - Environment ID
  - Service name (e.g., StudentPersonal)
  - Zone ID
  - Context ID
  - Access type (PROVIDE, CONSUME, SUBSCRIBE)
  - Access level (APPROVED, DENIED, PENDING)
  
  ## Tests Included
  
  - Create ACL entry
  - List ACL entries (all and filtered)
  - Get ACL entry by ID
  - Update ACL entry
  - Delete ACL entry
  - Error scenarios
  
  ## Important Notes
  
  - ACL entries require authentication
  - APPROVED entries grant access
  - DENIED entries explicitly deny access
  - Missing ACL entries result in 403 Forbidden
}
